OL,3,AChina warns it will protect its
OL,4,Ainterests after US widens sanctions
OL,5,Aagainst Iran
OL,6,
OL,7,FChina has vowed to protect its
OL,8,Finterests after the US announced plans
OL,9,Fto widen economic sanctions against
OL,10,FIran and its trading partners, which
OL,11,Finclude Beijing.
OL,13,FForeign ministry spokesman Lin Jian
OL,14,Fsaid China was firmly opposed to what
OL,15,Fit called "illegal unilateral
OL,16,Fsanctions" and would take "all
OL,17,Fnecessary measures" to safeguard its
OL,18,Frights.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
