OL,3,AChina warns it will protect its
OL,4,Ainterests after US widens sanctions
OL,5,Aagainst Iran
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis came after US Treasury Secretary
OL,8,FScott Bessent announced the new
OL,9,Fmeasures on Monday, warning any nation
OL,10,Ffinancially partnering with Iran would
OL,11,Fbe isolated.
OL,13,FChina is the biggest buyer of Iranian
OL,14,Foil, although the trade has declined
OL,15,Funder the US blockade of Iran's ports.
